  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ecosystem support for Creative Entrepreneurship in Chad</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Diplomatic Mission of the Netherlands in Chad formally initiated the Ecosystem Meet-Up in N&apos;Djamena and Moundou.The Ecosystem Meet-Up is an inspiring platform where entrepreneurs are equipped with skills in order to start new businesses, scale up and create jobs. Simultaneously, it will be a platform where local entrepreneurs can exchange, discuss, mutually learn and make use of the Ecosystem Meet-up network and become part of a vibrant community. This projects entails organising monthly meetings for the networks of entrepreneurs in N&#x2019;Djamena and Moundou, as well as exchange events between the two networks, aiming to strengthen the Chadian entrepreneurial ecosystems, and to facilitate exchange and cooperation between the stakeholders.The aim is to connect these stakeholders and formulate follow-up projects with insights gained from these Dutch ecosystem initiative events.</narrative>
  </description>
